{
  "_comment": [
    "Career-platform fingerprints for the profiler's board identification (crawler/profiler/platforms.mjs), schema fingerprints-v1. One row per platform:",
    "  id        platform name (reports and tallies use it)",
    "  provider  the jobcrawl provider that reads it, or null when there is none yet (then the row only names the platform)",
    "  hosts     regexes over a host: the vendor's own hosts (a page, a redirect target, a link, a script or iframe source on one)",
    "  cname     regexes over the CNAME target of the careers host (careers.acme.com -> acme.teamtailor.com)",
    "  markup    regexes over the page HTML that only this platform writes (class names, asset paths, footers, global objects)",
    "  slug      how to make the provider slug when the board sits on the employer's own host and no link gives it: 'origin' (https://host),",
    "            'host' (host only) or null (only a provider's own detect() on a link can give the slug)",
    "Seeded 2026-11-27 from the providers in providers.mjs / providers-extra.mjs and career-ops' SUPPORTED_JOB_BOARDS.md (MIT). A row's",
    "patterns must not match another platform's pages: the evaluation (eval-detect.mjs) reports precision per platform."
  ],
